    <Speech UniqueID="Bunnies_HowToHunt" x="4057.082" y="-5664.938" NativeText="How do I hunt rabbits?  It's so hard!" Situation="QuestTopic">
      <Replies>
        <SpeechRef UniqueID="Bunnies_Downwind" />
      </Replies>
      <Conditions>
        <Condition Type="QuestIsActive" Subject="Target" StringData="Bunnies_Hunt" />
        <Condition Type="VariableEquals" Subject="Target" SubjectID="TaughtHunting" />
      </Conditions>
    </Speech>
    <Speech UniqueID="Bunnies_Downwind" x="5126.861" y="-5748.8667" NativeText="Well, first of all you gotta make sure you approach downwind, so they can't smell you coming.">
      <Continues>
        <SpeechRef UniqueID="Bunnies_Cover" />
      </Continues>
    </Speech>
    <Speech UniqueID="Bunnies_Cover" x="6121.88232" y="-5806.735" NativeText="You'll also need to find some cover.  Bunnies have a wide field of view so they'll almost always see you coming otherwise.  Try to find one that's upwind of some forest, and creep up on it using bushes for cover.  Patience is key, don't startle them.">
      <Continues>
        <SpeechRef UniqueID="Bunnies_Bait" />
      </Continues>
    </Speech>
    <Speech UniqueID="Bunnies_Bait" x="7090.49561" y="-6094.819" NativeText="You could also throw some carrots around to attract them.  Or if you're handy you could build a rabbit trap with a bucket and some string, and a carrot for bait.  Put it somewhere you've seen rabbits before, and maybe you'll catch one of them that way.">
      <Replies>
        <SpeechRef UniqueID="Bunnies_ThanksForTips" />
        <SpeechRef UniqueID="Bunnies_ThanksForNothing" />
        <SpeechRef UniqueID="Bunnies_ABetterWay" />
        <SpeechRef UniqueID="Bunnies_HmmOkay" />
      </Replies>
      <Events>
        <StoryEvent Type="SetVariable" Subject="Actor" SubjectID="TaughtHunting" Data="1" />
      </Events>
    </Speech>
    <Speech UniqueID="Bunnies_ThanksForNothing" x="8216.029" y="-6112.568" NativeText="}:-| I already tried that!  Thanks for nothing, asshole.">
      <Replies>
        <SpeechRef UniqueID="Bunnies_MyHelp" />
